---
---

<section id="problem" class="py-24 px-6">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">
      <span class="gradient-text">The Problem</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="text-slate-400 text-lg mb-12 max-w-2xl">
      Data centers waste billions in energy every year. The AI boom is making it worse.
    </p>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <!-- Energy Waste -->
      <div class="gradient-border rounded-2xl p-8 glow">
        <div class="text-5xl font-bold gradient-text mb-4">~30%</div>
        <p class="text-white text-xl font-medium mb-4">of data center energy is wasted</p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-300">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-indigo-400 mt-1">→</span>
            <span>Zombie workloads running with no real purpose</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-indigo-400 mt-1">→</span>
            <span>Static resource allocation that doesn't adapt to actual load</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-indigo-400 mt-1">→</span>
            <span>Observability systems scraping constantly — even when nothing happens</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Grid Stress -->
      <div class="gradient-border rounded-2xl p-8 glow">
        <div class="text-5xl font-bold bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-red-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent mb-4">
          Grid Stress
        </div>
        <p class="text-white text-xl font-medium mb-4">AI boom is overloading energy grids</p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-300">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-amber-400 mt-1">→</span>
            <span>Single AI training run: hundreds of megawatts</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-amber-400 mt-1">→</span>
            <span>Grid operators can't predict data center load</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-amber-400 mt-1">→</span>
            <span>Emergency peak power is expensive & dirty</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm mt-8 text-right">
      Sources: IEA Data Centres Report, EU Energy Efficiency Directive
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
